{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>First time [the fifth?]</b><br>וְדִגְלוֹ. From the root דגל." "<b>Second time</b><br>He brought me to the house of wine and I became intoxicated with Him, and had this been in revealed form like the banner, then I would say to the maidens" "<b>Third time</b><br>וְדִגְלוֹ עָלַי. And I hear your words."], :book :song-of-songs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra's commentary on the Canticles" "http://beta.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH002030344/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:43:58.033700003Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}